WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.301 --> 00:00:02.315
- I'm excited to meet you.

00:00:02.315 --> 00:00:03.620
- I'm excited.

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.050
- I was so excited to have you on the show

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:07.530
but I know you already
actually know Meghan, right?

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:09.070
This is the Droege family, by the way,

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.517
but you already know Meghan, right?

00:00:10.517 --> 00:00:11.350
- [Ron] Hello.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:12.740
- I haven't seen you in so long.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:13.573
- I know.

00:00:13.573 --> 00:00:14.640
- You look amazing.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.420
- Thank you, you look great.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.378
- Thank you so much.

00:00:17.378 --> 00:00:19.180
(laughs)

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:21.410
- Yeah, Meghan and I
we met a long time ago

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.490
on a show I was on called "Undateable"

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.250
and came, and we had fun, we hit it off,

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.047
and she gave me her number
and said, "Let's hang out,

00:00:27.047 --> 00:00:28.710
"and just talk and chat,"

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.242
and I called her and it
just went, "do do doop."

00:00:31.242 --> 00:00:33.550
(laughs)

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:35.508
So I been waiting to see you.

00:00:35.508 --> 00:00:38.835
(audience laughs and applauds)

00:00:38.835 --> 00:00:40.580
- So, hey, Ron, don't worry about it.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:41.413
Don't worry about it, Ron,

00:00:41.413 --> 00:00:42.780
the number I gave you
is totally gonna work,

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:44.593
just keep calling it,
just keep calling it.

00:00:44.593 --> 00:00:46.090
(laughs)

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:49.110
- My phone number has changed
three times, this isn't a lie.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.760
Dad, Papa, stand up for me.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:51.593
- [Kelly] Papa.

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:52.660
- [Papa] Yeah, yeah, at least.

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:55.490
- I had to change my number
at least three times so.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:57.861
Yeah, I never got a call.

00:00:57.861 --> 00:01:00.210
(laughs)

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:01.770
- That was so rude, Ron (laughs).

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:02.848
- It happens.

00:01:02.848 --> 00:01:03.820
It's okay.

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:06.080
- I heard you started singing lessons

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:07.800
though recently.
- I did, yeah.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.970
'Cause I've been doing a lot
of voiceovers and cartoons,

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:11.350
we're both in the "Trolls" movie

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:12.183
together.
- We are,

00:01:12.183 --> 00:01:13.016
we're both in the "World Tour,"

00:01:13.016 --> 00:01:13.849
yeah.
- Congrats.

00:01:13.849 --> 00:01:14.682
(audience applauds)
I love that.

00:01:14.682 --> 00:01:17.300
- That's amazing, I
totally forgot about that.

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:18.835
They do have us singing a lot,

00:01:18.835 --> 00:01:19.668
and, yeah.
- They have us singing a lot

00:01:19.668 --> 00:01:21.060
and singing as a cartoon voice,

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.477
and I'm like, "I can't sing regularly,

00:01:23.477 --> 00:01:25.700
"so why you trying to make
me sing as a giraffe?"

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:26.565
That's crazy.

00:01:26.565 --> 00:01:27.398
(laughs)

00:01:27.398 --> 00:01:28.600
- 'Cause it probably
sounds really fun (laughs).

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.322
- Yes, he's got longer
throat, he got velvety voice.

00:01:32.322 --> 00:01:33.291
(laughs)

00:01:33.291 --> 00:01:34.137
- That's awesome.

00:01:34.137 --> 00:01:35.633
- But I was like, "Let me
get some singing lessons in,"

00:01:35.633 --> 00:01:37.840
because I think that's the
only thing I'm missing.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:41.361
I'm already hilarious,
I'm already very handsome.

00:01:41.361 --> 00:01:43.200
(audience applauds)

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.306
- [Meghan] Amen, yes.

00:01:44.306 --> 00:01:45.567
- You're like a triple threat.

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:46.400
That's what you're working on.
- Yeah, I'm trying

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:47.530
to become a triple threat.

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:50.080
And then you know, just
take over the world.

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:50.913
- I love it.

00:01:50.913 --> 00:01:53.270
Well, I feel like your dreams
are gonna become a reality

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:55.500
because you're really into something

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.750
that helps those dreams
come a reality, right?

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:58.583
- I am.

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:00.840
Lately I've been big into making

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.797
what I call "vision boards," dream boards.

00:02:02.797 --> 00:02:03.630
- Oh I know vision boards.

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:04.900
- Yes, I have one.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:06.670
Oh yeah, in Nashville, that's--

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:08.030
- Do y'all have vision boards?

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:09.020
- Well we made notebooks,

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.770
we cut out newspaper articles,
and magazine pictures,

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:14.622
and made notebooks for our travels.

00:02:14.622 --> 00:02:17.069
- Oh my gosh, I love it.

00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:19.385
What's on your vision board?

00:02:19.385 --> 00:02:20.218
- I got it for you

00:02:20.218 --> 00:02:21.051
right here.
- You have a vision board.

00:02:21.051 --> 00:02:23.183
- Let me show it to you.
- You're sneaky, Ron.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:24.953
- I brought it.

00:02:24.953 --> 00:02:25.786
- [Kelly] Oh my God Australia.

00:02:25.786 --> 00:02:27.430
- I had it on there,
and went to Australia,

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:30.070
and I did comedy there in April.

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:30.903
So that happened.

00:02:30.903 --> 00:02:33.760
I'm going to Japan in December.

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:35.170
Hopefully I'm gonna get a baby.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.157
That's my new baby.

00:02:36.157 --> 00:02:36.990
(laughs)

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.950
- I love it, I love it.

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.840
- I'm just trying to stay
committed in everything,

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.060
my acting, my comedy, my girlfriend,

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:44.450
just trying to stay committed.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:45.530
- That's beautiful.

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:46.730
But I do have a question.

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:49.713
You have not one, but
three, pictures of The Rock.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:51.660
What does this mean?

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:52.742
- What is your point?

00:02:52.742 --> 00:02:55.230
(laughs)

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.880
- I mean, I love The Rock too.
- Show 'em.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:58.710
- It's just on your
vision board, that's cool.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:00.305
- Yeah, I love The Rock, he is amazing.

00:03:00.305 --> 00:03:01.138
- [Kelly] You wanna meet him?

00:03:01.138 --> 00:03:03.880
- He is the epitome of what
a man should be, to me.

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:06.570
He is perfect, he is
amazing, he is a leader,

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:09.046
he is basically the Beyonce for boys.

00:03:09.046 --> 00:03:12.398
(laughs)
(audience applauds)

00:03:12.398 --> 00:03:13.320
- He is the Beyonce.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.740
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:15.573
- Yeah.

00:03:15.573 --> 00:03:17.200
- Yes.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.430
- Okay, so is he on your vision board

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:20.880
'cause you wanna work with him?

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:23.100
- I wanna work with him,
I wanna be like him,

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:25.271
I want him to carry me
while I eat ice cream.

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:26.431
(laughs)

00:03:26.431 --> 00:03:27.758
(audience applauds)

00:03:27.758 --> 00:03:30.143
- I wanna make that a
part of the show somehow.

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:31.600
(laughs)

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.140
Okay, but you've accomplished, right?

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:34.390
You said you've been to Australia,

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:36.030
you're going to Japan the end of the year,

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:37.157
where's your other vision board?

00:03:37.157 --> 00:03:38.800
- Oh, that's why I was
so excited about it.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:39.970
I got so much stuff done,

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:42.020
we're only about halfway through the year,

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.660
I started adding to my vision board.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:45.649
- Oh my God.
- And you're in it.

00:03:45.649 --> 00:03:46.487
(laughs)

00:03:46.487 --> 00:03:48.840
(audience applauds)

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.170
- This is pretty great.

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:51.482
Meghan you made it too.

00:03:51.482 --> 00:03:52.469
- [Meghan] Am I there?

00:03:52.469 --> 00:03:55.570
- You didn't even answer
the phone, but you made it.

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:56.403
(laughs)
- That's me.

00:03:56.403 --> 00:03:58.190
- Yeah, that's why she's in the corner.

00:03:58.190 --> 00:03:59.484
- Are we just chilling on the couch?

00:03:59.484 --> 00:04:01.149
(audience laughs and applauds)

00:04:01.149 --> 00:04:02.468
- I'm in the corner.

00:04:02.468 --> 00:04:03.534
I made it.
- I made the couch.

00:04:03.534 --> 00:04:04.367
(laughs)

00:04:04.367 --> 00:04:05.270
Now that's amazing.

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:06.536
You're gonna sing and play with us.

00:04:06.536 --> 00:04:09.260
We're gonna ride horses
and off into the sunset.

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:10.093
- [Ron] Absolutely we are.

00:04:10.093 --> 00:04:10.926
- I love it.

00:04:10.926 --> 00:04:11.980
- [Meghan] I'm reading a book.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:13.502
- And you're reading a book.
- That's new for me.

00:04:13.502 --> 00:04:15.224
(laughs)
- This is all coming together.

00:04:15.224 --> 00:04:16.220
(laughs)
- That's like a big deal.

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:17.454
That's my goal.

00:04:17.454 --> 00:04:18.287
(laughs)

00:04:18.287 --> 00:04:20.086
(audience applauds)

00:04:20.086 --> 00:04:21.800
- I love your comedy too,
it's always uplifting,

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:22.880
it's very positive,

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:23.713
it makes me laugh.
- Thank you.

00:04:23.713 --> 00:04:25.053
- You're very, very talented.

